# Project Rules

- Always use `loguru` for logging; never `print()`.
- All public functions and classes must have type annotations.
- Pydantic v2 `BaseModel` is the standard for all data models.
- Settings must be read from `app.core.config.settings`; never hardcode values.
- New modules in `app/` must have a corresponding `__init__.py`.
- Tests live in `tests/` and mirror the `app/` directory structure.
- Run `ruff check . --fix` and `mypy app/` before considering a task complete.
